# AKS Automatic Engineering Training: The Golden Path

Welcome to the interactive engineering training for AKS Automatic.
This course is designed to be **Hands-on**. You will learn by fixing a broken application and deploying it to production standards.

## 🏁 Start Here
1.  **Read the Plan**: [Interactive Learning Plan](INTERACTIVE_LEARNING_PLAN.md)
2.  **Get the Code**: Go to [scenarios/00-legacy-app](scenarios/00-legacy-app/). This is your starting point.

## 🏆 The Challenges
The course is divided into 4 challenges. Complete them in order.

*   **Level 1**: [The Container Diet](challenges/01-container-optimization.md) - Fix the Dockerfile.
*   **Level 2**: [Helm-ification](challenges/02-helm-packaging.md) - Create the Helm Chart.
*   **Level 3**: [The GitOps Handshake](challenges/03-cicd-pipeline.md) - Build the CI/CD Pipeline.
*   **Level 4**: [Chaos Monkey Hunt](challenges/04-troubleshooting-hunt.md) - Debug a production failure.

## 📚 Reference Material (The "Textbook")
If you get stuck or want to understand the theory, read the modules:
*   [Module 1: Foundations](MODULE_1_AKS_FOUNDATIONS.md)
*   [Module 2: Containers & Helm](MODULE_2_CONTAINERS_HELM.md)
*   [Module 3: CI/CD](MODULE_3_CI_CD_ADO_ARGO.md)
*   [Module 4: Troubleshooting](MODULE_4_TROUBLESHOOTING.md)

